{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅的愛女陳康堤今年2月被揭與「香港網球一哥」黃澤林（Coleman）低調交往，4月公開戀情，惟2人於9月底傳情變。</p><p>黃澤林後來現身網上直播時，承認和康堤分手。</p><p>康堤昨天現身商台戶外直播節目時，也承認已與黃澤林分開，她說：「我們已經分手，情緒會有些低落。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.969501+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:26:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.787599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536855+00:00","content_hash":"99114dce7f8cf46d91b429667740e039885e5b61521f696cdf0c5c1793581730","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}